1. Artwork Information / 작품 정보

English

- Title: Me Too (Korean title: 미 투)
- Original Title: Yo, también
- Year: 2009
- Korean Release Date: April 15, 2010
- Country: Spain
- Type: Feature Film
- Genre: Drama / Romance
- Directors: Álvaro Pastor and Antonio Naharro
- Main Cast: Pablo Pineda (Daniel), Lola Dueñas (Laura)
- Description: Yo, también is a Spanish feature film directed by Álvaro Pastor and Antonio Naharro. It tells the story of Daniel, a 34-year-old man from Seville with Down syndrome who becomes the first European person with Down syndrome to obtain a university degree. After graduating, he begins working in public administration, where he meets Laura, a coworker without an apparent disability. Their relationship develops into a close friendship and eventually becomes romantic, challenging social expectations and prejudice toward people with intellectual disabilities. [1][2]
- Disease or Disability: Down syndrome (Trisomy 21).

